WEBVTT

00:04:28.038 --> 00:04:30.204
Well, creativity and imagination,

00:04:30.246 --> 00:04:32.829
those are the things
that allow us to create problems

00:04:32.871 --> 00:04:35.163
when we don't know how to attack it.

00:04:35.204 --> 00:04:38.038
They enable us to make
something out of nothing.

00:04:38.079 --> 00:04:40.871
If you look at the apps
that are out there and the tablets,

00:04:40.913 --> 00:04:44.746
and the iPads, iPhones, and Androids,
20 years ago they didn’t exist.

00:04:44.913 --> 00:04:48.871
So, how is it that we got from something
where there was nothing and expanded?

00:04:48.913 --> 00:04:51.871
It was our imagination.
It was our creativity.

00:04:51.913 --> 00:04:55.371
And these are the things
that allow us to figure out new things.

00:04:55.413 --> 00:04:57.329
And so, I have a robot that is creative,

00:04:57.371 --> 00:04:59.121
it plays piano, is a composer,

00:04:59.163 --> 00:05:02.663
and if you listen, it plays
"Twinkle, Twinkle Little Star."